BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fire and Fall Prevention for Older Adults
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260831T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260831T150000
UID:6a6230d39943bdf31ea0f47d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Fire Services will be presenting a Fire Safety Present
 ation\, followed by Q&A for older adults and families. Topics covered incl
 ude:\nPreventing a fire from happening to you\nCauses of home fires\nPlace
 ment/need for smoke & CO alarms\nEliminating nuisance alarms\nEscape plann
 ing for special needs\nCalling for help (how/when/from where)\nFire safety
  in high-rise buildings
