DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261028T153000
UID:695eea6594297d3600a3ed12@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Join us and make some crafts! Express your creativity throw Diamond paint
 ing\, a relaxing\, mosaic-style craft where tiny resin "diamonds" are plac
 ed on a numbered adhesive canvas to create a sparkling image.\nDrop-in\, a
 ll are welcome. Call 416-393-7653 for more info.\nSnacks and refreshments
  are provided for all participants at 3:30 pm. Ingredient lists will be av
 ailable at the program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerstein C
 risis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:Sanderson\, Program Room
