UID:69e14a6f8ddc1caf5f1d6b88@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film. Ingredient lists will 
 be available upon request.\nLethal Seas\nThe oceans absorb about a quarter
  of the carbon dioxide in our atmosphere\, but rising emissions are pushin
 g this process into dangerous territory. As seawater becomes more acidic\,
  a silent threat is putting countless marine species at risk. Closed Capti
 ons. 60 minutes. 2013.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e14a6f8ddc1caf5f1d6b88
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
