UID:697e3bbccbf6405d3565de30@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Yearning for yarn? Join our afternoon needlecraft circle! Whet
 her you are a seasoned crochetier or picking up a set of knitting needles 
 for the first time\, everyone is welcome to share techniques\, enjoy frien
 dly conversation\, and learn a new skill.  Connect with fellow craftspeopl
 e as you work on your project. We will have some supplies available for be
 ginners\, but please feel free to bring your own. Drop-in\; no registratio
 n required.
LOCATION:York Woods\, 1st Floor Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/697e3bbccbf6405d3565de30
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
