DESCRIPTION:New day and time!\nExperienced knitter or new\, bring your pro
 jects with you. New to knitting or crochet? Don’t worry\, just bring you
 r supplies with you and we can help you get started.  Share tips\, share s
 tories\, make new friends.\nDrop In
LOCATION:Elmbrook Park\, Program room
