DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261001T153000
UID:69867ececbf1533ca5365bfd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in.\nDo you have questions about your tablet\, phone\, la
 ptop or email? Need help with e-books or other online library services? We
  help with your technical questions\n! No technology repairs
LOCATION:Richview\, 2nd Floor Room A
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69867ececbf1533ca5365bfd
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:ADULT BOARD GAME SOCIAL
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260810T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260810T200000
UID:6a3983e8c78687f2fd2dde83@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us monthly at the Malvern Library for Adult Board Game So
 cial\, a relaxed evening of tabletop games and good company.\nHave a favou
 rite board game? Feel free to bring it along and share it with others. Sho
 rter and easy-to-learn games work best\, but there is always room to explo
 re something new together.\nThe library will also provide a selection of b
 oard games for casual play. No experience needed. This is a welcoming\, lo
 w-pressure space to learn\, play\, and connect with others.\nDrop-in.\nMon
 day\, July 13th 6-8pm\nMonday\, August 10th 6-8pm
LOCATION:Malvern\, 1st Floor Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3983e8c78687f2fd2dde83
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
