DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260919T163000
UID:6931f2a276261f28005d7d64@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Come and join the F.R.E.S.H. group for a Saturday screening of popular mov
 ies.\nWe'll be playing the following films\nSeptember 5th –\nPapillon (
 1973)\nSeptember 12th –\nCabaret\nSeptember 19th –\nWhat's Eating Gilb
 ert Grape\nSeptember 26th –\nMoonlight\nDrop in\, no registration is req
 uired.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all participants. Ingredi
 ent lists will be available at the program.\nThis program is in collaborat
 ion with\nGerstein Crisis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, First floor\, Activity Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6931f2a276261f28005d7d64
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
