BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Digital Life Skills for Seniors: Online Shopping
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260820T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260820T153000
UID:6a6128070ed7b4521ed6d9ce@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program is for people who have basic internet skills but 
 want to learn about the different online shopping websites and Apps. We wi
 ll cover searching and researching goods & services online\, tips for onli
 ne purchasing\, the process of making online purchases\, how to stay safe 
 when shopping online\, methods of payment for online purchases. Resource h
 andout provided.
LOCATION:Deer Park\, Main Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a6128070ed7b4521ed6d9ce
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tea & Entertainment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260814T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260814T160000
UID:69e14b52129f127438390197@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy watching DVDs in the Library Auditorium.\nCoffee\, tea a
 nd cookies or snacks will be served after the film.  Ingredient lists will
  be available upon request.\nLife is One\nLife is One follows three orphan
 ed sun bear cubs in Indonesia as they are raised by a foster parent and pr
 epared for their return to the wild. Filmed deep in the rainforest\, the s
 tory celebrates their playful spirit while reminding us that all living th
 ings are connected and deserve our care and respect\n.\nClosed Captions. 5
 2 minutes.2017
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e14b52129f127438390197
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
