 rop in to meet our settlement worker every Friday from 9am - 5 pm.\nVisit 
 our branch or contact Ada Tao at 416-770-0312 or atao@cathcrosscultural.or
 g.\nIn partnership with Catholic Crosscultural Services.\nPlease bring you
 r immigration documents (PR card) with you
LOCATION:Burrows Hall
