 tion using a search engine\nExplore a web site in detail to understand its
  key components\nUpon completion of this class students will be able to us
 e the internet at a beginner level and complete simple searches.\nPrerequi
 sites: Computer for Beginners 1 & 2 or basic mouse and keyboarding skills\
 nFormat: Hands-on with demonstrations.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nTh
 e personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Lib
 rary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). 
