BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Insider’s Guide to Publishing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260813T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260813T193000
UID:6a6907290e562e28009d1258@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Aimed at both readers and writers\, this lively presentation p
 ulls back the curtain on Canadian publishing and provides insight into the
  world of the book industry. For those who wish to pursue publication\, th
 is is an opportunity to learn how to submit proposals and query letters an
 d get feedback on your book description.\nPresented by:\nCynthia Good\, fo
 rmer President and Publisher of Penguin Books.\nFirst come\, first served 
 until capacity is reached. All are welcome.
LOCATION:St. Lawrence
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a6907290e562e28009d1258
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
