BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wednesday Afternoon @ the Movies: The Astronaut
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261028T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261028T150000
UID:6a5ea7bbf213992f00c5be31@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Wednesday afternoon at the library for a screening 
 of The Astronaut movie.\nRescued from the ocean\, astronaut Sam Walker is 
 placed under surveillance following her return from her first space missio
 n amid fears an alien presence has returned from space with her.\nRated 14
 A. 1hr 30 mins.\nEnglish Subtitles for the Deaf and Hard of Hearing (SDH) 
 when available.
LOCATION:Weston\, Program Room. Lower Level.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5ea7bbf213992f00c5be31
