DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260912T150000
UID:6a3961e07550c8bf9f5f04b5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this presentation\, Registered Psychotherapist Ann Schnurr 
 will explore how stress affects both physical and emotional health\, and c
 hallenges the common belief that stress is harmful. Participants will lear
 n how to recognize the body’s stress responses\, reframe stress as a sou
 rce of motivation and growth\, and develop effective techniques to transfo
 rm negative stress into a powerful force for personal and professional suc
 cess.
