UID:6a21bb354407827f8aa29cc5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For those of us who may see ourselves as a "work in progress\,
 " come learn and grow together with a selection of classic and popular per
 sonal development titles.\nBooks are first-come\, first-served.\nTo get a 
 copy of the month's book selection\, please ask at the Adult Information D
 esk or call 416-396-3975 to see if a copy is still available. Many titles 
 are also available in other formats for you to place your own hold.\nThe 
 title for the August 20th meeting is:\nBig Feelings\nThe title for the Sep
 tember 17th meeting is:\nLighter\nThe title for the October 15th meeting i
 s:\nThe Power of Now\nThe title for the November 19th meeting is:\nSet Bou
 ndaries\, Find Peace\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informa
 tion on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Pub
 lic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information wi
 ll only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluati
