DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260901T143000
UID:6a4eb9c2cca66c2f00a222d4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join other book lovers in your community and participate in li
 vely discussions of popular books. This book club will meet every third Tu
 esday of the month for a lively discussion in a welcoming\, relaxed settin
 g. New members are always welcome and encouraged to join.\nAugust 18\, 202
 6 -\nUnorthodox by Deborah Feldman\nSeptember 15\, 2026 -\nThe History of 
 Love by Nicole Krauss\nOctober 20\, 2026\n- Paper Girl by Beth Macy\nCopie
 s of the book are available for borrowing at the Fairview Library.\nDrop-i
 n\, no registration necessary.\n[Start with your own unique description of
  the Book Club and use the 'Title' button to link to the title being discu
 ssed for the month]
LOCATION:Fairview
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a4eb9c2cca66c2f00a222d4
