DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Join us and share your favourite song of the moment\, or a song that means
  something to you. Discover new music\, and meet other folks that share yo
 ur love of music.\nDrop-in\, all are welcome.\nSnacks and refreshments are
  provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at the 
 program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Centre's 
 F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
