 try for text\, numbers\, and basic functions: Sum\, AutoSum and Average\nC
 reate and save your first workbook and worksheets\nUpon completion of this
  class\, you will be able to use Excel at a basic level.\nPrerequisites: B
 asic mouse and keyboard skills are required.\nFormat: Hands-on with demons
 trations
