DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260804T120000
UID:6a3435f1caf9343600640b80@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every other Tuesday\, at the Malvern Library for our S
 eniors Social.\nEnjoy trivia\, bingo\, coffee\, chess\, and relaxed conver
 sation in a welcoming and friendly space.\nParticipants can explore librar
 y resources\, learn about programs offered across the library system\, and
  get support navigating the TPL website at a comfortable\, relaxed pace.\n
 A selection of books will be available to explore\, covering a range of in
 terests and topics. It’s a great opportunity to meet new people\, stay c
 onnected\, and have fun.\nUpcoming Special Features:\nJuly 7th: Seniors So
 cial - Music Share for Seniors 10-11am\nJoin us for a special music-themed
  social where participants can request songs\, share memories\, and connec
 t through conversation and music\nJuly 21st: Seniors Social - Bone Health 
 101 from 10-11am\nJoin a volunteer from Osteoporosis Canada for an informa
 tive presentation on bone health\, fall prevention and healthy aging.\nDro
 p-in program. No registration required.\nUpcoming Dates (Tuesday):\nJuly 7
 \,      21 2026\nAugust 4\,      18 2026
LOCATION:Malvern\, 1st Floor Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3435f1caf9343600640b80
