 ional artists in a fun\, healthy\, and exciting arts program\,\nMoving Sto
 ries\n.\nThese free classes offer an introduction into the enriching world
  of art and creativity through movement and music. These activities have p
 roven to improve circulation\, retain joint mobility\, promote mental stim
 ulation\, improve posture and coordination\, and build strength and balanc
 e.\nNo previous movement experience required.\nSuggested Age: 60 +\nGo at 
