DESCRIPTION:Craft and socialize in a friendly and welcoming environment at
  our monthly adult and seniors crafternoon!  All materials provided.\nCon
 sider wearing clothes that you don't mind getting messy.\nJune\, July* & A
 ugust - Acrylic Painting (each month will be a different project)\nDrop in
 . Space is limited to 25 participants.  Arrive early to secure a spot!\nF
 or the July session only: this program will run in Room B instead of the u
 sual location in Room A
