 ona Awad\, will be available to pick up from the first floor reference des
 k beginning in mid-August. This title is also available as an eBook\, as a
 n eAudiobook\, as an Audiobook on CD\, and in Large Print.\nUpcoming Title
 s:\nSeptember 24 - All's Well by Mona Awad\nOctober 29 - To Be Announced\n
 November 26 - The Lion Women of Tehran by Marjan Kamali\nJanuary 28 - To B
 e Announced\nFebruary 25 - Encampment by Maggie Helwig\nMarch 25 - The Tai
 nted Cup by Robert Jackson Bennett
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 2/3\, 2nd Floor
