  us on Friday evenings once a month for a warm and lively discussion of o
 ur selected books! All adults are welcome!\nIf you're looking to socializ
 e with your local book worms\, this is the group for you!\nThis year we wi
 ll be reading:\nJune -\nFirst meeting - Introductions\, and pick up a cop
 y of\nOpen\, Heaven\nby Sean Hewitt.\nJuly\n-\nOpen\, Heaven\nby Sean Hewi
 tt\nAugust\n-\nI Leave It Up To You\,\nby Jinwoo Chong\nSeptember\n-\nYour
  Driver is Waiting\n\, by Priya Guns\nOctober\n-\nHijab Butch Blues\,\nby 
