UID:6a398579c134422d50e9c2db@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:David Townsend presents and reads excerpts from his historical
  novel\,\nThe Ram in the Thicket\n\,\n(Palmetto Publishing\, 2025) preface
 d with some historical background. Set in medieval Norwich\, England\, th
 e plot centers on the meeting of two major figures in women's literary his
 tory\, Julian of Norwich and Margery Kempe. The book will be available for
  sale for $25 cash.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informat
 ion on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Publ
 ic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information wil
