DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260801T110000
UID:6a3e93a486636e3d0050d4e0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join other handicraft hobbyists to share ideas\, skills\, and 
 stories while you work on your own projects. Whether you knit\, crochet\, 
 cross-stitch\, etc.\, drop in for light refreshments and great conversatio
 ns with other crafters.\nPlease bring your own projects and materials\, as
  this is\nnot a class\n\, and no supplies are available\n. Limited instruc
 tion is available for most needlework hobbies. All skill levels are welcom
 e.\nFor adults and older adults. Registration is\noptional\nif you would l
 ike reminders. Please register online\, in-branch\, or call\n416-396-8964\
 n.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form 
 is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\
 , sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used fo
